      "description": "Sterling College Please ensure Javascript is enabled for purposes of website accessibility Skip to main content Search form Search Admissions Apply Warrior Next Steps Visit Campus Jump Start Days New Student Orientation Enrollment Fee Housing Deposit and Housing Transfer Students International Students Military CA$H Program Financial Aid Tuition and Expenses Academics Majors Online Learning Graduate Programs Honors Program Academic Catalog Academic Resources Course/Finals Schedule C.S. Lewis Center Mabee Library Registrar Commencement Adjunct Information Faculty Directory Athletics Arts Music Art & Design Theatre Comm. Media Resources About What We Believe Office of the President Warrior Wearhouse Freeman Lecture Series Employee Directory Athletic Calendar Parent/Student Calendar 2026-2027 Career Services Academic Support Student Success Warrior Wire Student Email Employee Email MySterling Campus Map Residence Life Campus Safety Health and Counseling Marketing Office Building and Office Directory Conference Services Employment Giving Project 15:58 Sterling Scholarship Fund Cooper Society Kelsey Society Gift Planning Ways to Give Meet the Advancement Team Give Online Give Cryptocurrency Search You are here Home / Admissions / Deposit and Housing Student Life Alumni Online Canvas Deposit and Housing Majors Majors Minors Minors Earn Your Degree Online Online Programs Academic Support Academic Support Pay Your Deposit Have you been accepted to Sterling and have decided to call SC your new home? Pay your deposit today to secure your spot in the new student class! A $100 non-refundable Housing Deposit ($50 for commuters) is required in order to hold your financial aid package and must be paid before you can apply for housing and register for classes. $100 Non Refundable On Campus Deposit $50 Non Refundable Off Campus Deposit Please use the links above to pay online or you may pay over the phone by calling 620-278-4201. Apply for Housing Once you have paid your deposit and it’s been processed, you will be eligible to apply for housing. You can fill out the new student housing application or off campus application (must meet eligible requirements) by logging into your mySterling account and going to the Student Life tab. You will receive login information within 3-5 business days of paying your deposit. If you have not received this information, please email admissions@sterling.edu for assistance. Check out our dorms by clicking below! ​ Housing Options Have a question? Ask your counselor. Admissions Requirements Request Info New Student Enrollment Housing Deposit and Housing Room Grant Enrollment Fee Tuition and Expenses Financial Aid Online Programs Meet Our Ambassadors Meet Our Team Home-School Students Honors Program International Students Transfer Students Military Forms California Connection Colorado Connection Viewbook Sterling College Faith and Missions Sterling College 125 W.Cooper Sterling, KS 67579 Contact & Feedback 800-346-1017 | 620-278-2173 About SC What We Believe Advancement Campus Directory Virtual Tour Human Resources Privacy Policy Translate Academics Departments Course & Finals Schedule Registrar Online Learning Student Email Employee Email mySterling Catalog Quick Links Visit Campus Athletics Financial Aid Student Life Student Services Warrior Wearhouse Accessibility Title IX Consumerism at a Glance CARES Act Reporting Copyright 2026 Sterling College, all rights reserved. Facebook Google Plus Twitter Youtube Instagram"
